<%# Engine-owned layout classes for the admin pages (admin overview, contracts
    index, audit trail), scoped under the .cs- prefix like the public
    catalogue's stylesheet (shared/_public_styles).

    Why not Tailwind utilities or inline styles: the host compiles its CSS
    once, at image build time, from whatever classes its content scan saw
    then, and Decidim's admin views carry no flex-wrap / gap-y classes — so
    the button rows these pages need cannot be built from the host bundle
    (docs/public-ui.md). Named classes keep the markup free of inline styles
    and let anyone restyle them.

    Delivery: the admin layout has no :css_content slot (that is the public
    layout's); it displays Decidim's :head snippets, so the block is added
    there — once per request, however many partials nest. Where no snippet
    registry exists (the dummy harness) the block renders in place.

    Override points:
      1. Host or other modules can target the classes from their own CSS.
         Selectors are single classes (no ids, no !important), so any plain
         rule of equal or later order wins.
      2. A host app can replace this whole partial by placing a file at the
         same view path (app/views/decidim/contracts_sk/shared/
         _admin_styles.html.erb) — Rails prefers host views over engine
         views.

    Classes:
      .cs-admin-actions  header action buttons (side by side, never wrapping,
                         pushed right, no shrinking inside .item_show__header)
      .cs-admin-chips    wrapping rows of chip/filter buttons with a gap
      .cs-admin-more     breathing room above a "show all" button
      .cs-admin-hint     small top margin for a hint line under a button row
      .cs-admin-notes    the notes list (ordered, no bullets)
      .cs-admin-note     one internal review note (author line + body)
      .cs-admin-note-meta  a note's author (strong) and time, wrapping on narrow screens
      .cs-admin-note-body  a note's text: newlines kept, long words wrapped
      .cs-admin-note-visibility  the muted "internal only" line above the thread
      .cs-admin-note-form  the append form: label above a full-width textarea
      .cs-admin-rules    a readable bulleted rules/problems list (the bundle strips list styles)
      .cs-admin-import   the import preview table: left-aligned, tabular line numbers,
                         right-aligned amounts (__num) and per-row error lists (__errors) %>
<% unless @cs_admin_styles_rendered %>
  <% @cs_admin_styles_rendered = true %>
  <% css = capture do %>
<style>
  .cs-admin-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: auto; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .cs-admin-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .cs-admin-more { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .cs-admin-hint { margin-top: .5rem; }
  .cs-admin-notes { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; max-width: 72ch; }
  .cs-admin-note { padding: .875rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, .1); }
  .cs-admin-note:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  .cs-admin-note-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: .25rem .75rem; margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
  .cs-admin-note-meta time { font-size: .875rem; color: #3e4c5c; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cs-admin-note-body { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; line-height: 1.5; }
  .cs-admin-note-visibility { margin: 0; font-size: .875rem; color: #3e4c5c; }
  .cs-admin-note-form { max-width: 72ch; }
  .cs-admin-note-form label { display: block; }
  .cs-admin-note-form textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin: .375rem 0 .75rem; }
  .cs-admin-rules { list-style: disc; margin: .5rem 0 0 1.25rem; padding: 0; max-width: 72ch; }
  .cs-admin-rules li { margin-bottom: .5rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-import th, .table-list.cs-admin-import td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-import tbody th { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: #3e4c5c; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-import .cs-admin-import__num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cs-admin-import__errors { list-style: none; margin: .375rem 0 0; padding: 0; font-size: .875rem; color: #8a1c1c; }
  .cs-admin-import__errors li + li { margin-top: .25rem; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-import td:nth-child(2) { white-space: nowrap; }
  .cs-admin-import caption { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
</style>
  <% end %>
  <% if respond_to?(:snippets) %>
    <% snippets.add(:head, css) %>
  <% else %>
    <%= css %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
